{"title":"2024 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 13","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(pretty_good,_but_needs_more_explanation_on_the_catalan_numbers)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (pretty good, but needs more explanation on the catalan numbers)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4_(slightly_confusing,_but_it_was_how_i_did_it_too)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4 (slightly confusing, but it was how i did it too)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_DDM\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by DDM</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solutions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solutions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_SquishBJ_(AIME_Qualifier)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by SquishBJ (AIME Qualifier)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Buzz Bunny is hopping up and down a set of stairs, one step at a time. In how many ways can Buzz Bunny start on the ground, make a sequence of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> hops, and end up back on the ground?\n(For example, one sequence of hops is up-up-down-down-up-down.)\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:2024-AMC8-q13.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/f/f1/2024-AMC8-q13.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"310\" height=\"177\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/d/68d81bd0ce783099ecb75577d3b4e93fd3735949.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 4 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 5 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 6 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 8 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"360\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Looking at the answer choices, you see that you can list them out. \nDoing this gets you:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/4/8f4642cd8734486d429b91f24277ecb6967c3792.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathit{UUDDUD}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"85\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/1/1a1ec65248915a075962658a29dd97a7ef764be9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathit{UDUDUD}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"85\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/7/3671d331dd8142c4a60304f9ec9ea1d0cbf023f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathit{UUUDDD}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"85\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/7/f272387a62018fa8947c636136143ce5247e56d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathit{UDUUDD}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"85\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/9/1c91299bd46454e8fe4d31083fa469572bafd077.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathit{UUDUDD}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"85\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>Counting all the paths listed above gets you <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/f/88f608fbcbdcd17dc0164fe2677b6ee1bb9f92ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)} \\ 5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"54\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p>~ALWAYSRIGHT11\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Any combination can be written as some re-arrangement of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/7/3671d331dd8142c4a60304f9ec9ea1d0cbf023f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathit{UUUDDD}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"85\" height=\"14\" />. Clearly we must end going down, and start going up, so we need the number of ways to insert 2 <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/b/e2bbebb3bd73f1ae5c64098ab0244f739abf7ca4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$U$\" width=\"14\" height=\"12\" />'s and 2 <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />'s into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/c/eac30f0049d62357160184f3d413f74094a1324e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$U\\, \\_ \\, \\_ \\, \\_ \\, \\_ \\, D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"71\" height=\"14\" />. There are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/d/50df56edb897dfe1ae154aa53f7dd02516acc0b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${4\\choose 2}=6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"70\" height=\"53\" /> ways, but we have to remove the case <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/3/2f31d60107ce1748d63281de1ec917995c8e038c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathit{UDDUUD}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"85\" height=\"14\" />, giving us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/a/66a140486a6900048ea83c3db3adc932efad6f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"54\" height=\"28\" />. \n</p><p><br />\n- We know there are no more cases since there will be at least one <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/b/e2bbebb3bd73f1ae5c64098ab0244f739abf7ca4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$U$\" width=\"14\" height=\"12\" /> before we have a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> (from the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/b/e2bbebb3bd73f1ae5c64098ab0244f739abf7ca4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$U$\" width=\"14\" height=\"12\" />), at least two <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/b/e2bbebb3bd73f1ae5c64098ab0244f739abf7ca4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$U$\" width=\"14\" height=\"12\" />'S before two <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />'s (since we removed the one case), and at least three <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/b/e2bbebb3bd73f1ae5c64098ab0244f739abf7ca4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$U$\" width=\"14\" height=\"12\" />'s before three <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />'s, as we end with the third <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />. \n</p><p>~Sahan Wijetunga\n</p><p>with minor edits from ~shaopl2022\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28pretty_good.2C_but_needs_more_explanation_on_the_catalan_numbers.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(pretty_good,_but_needs_more_explanation_on_the_catalan_numbers)\">Solution 3 (pretty good, but needs more explanation on the catalan numbers)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (pretty good, but needs more explanation on the catalan numbers)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>These numbers are clearly the Catalan numbers. Since we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> steps, we need the third Catalan number, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/a/66a140486a6900048ea83c3db3adc932efad6f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"54\" height=\"28\" />.\n~andliu766\n</p><p>with minor edits from ~shaopl2022\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_4_.28slightly_confusing.2C_but_it_was_how_i_did_it_too.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4_(slightly_confusing,_but_it_was_how_i_did_it_too)\">Solution 4 (slightly confusing, but it was how i did it too)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4 (slightly confusing, but it was how i did it too)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The first step must be a U, last step must be a D. After the third step we can get only position 3 or position 1. In the first case there is only one way: UUUDDD. In the second case we have two way to get this position UDU and UUD. Similarly, we have two way return to position 0 (UDD and DUD). Therefore, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/f/c7f675f4b75d151800a967d19bd1a88752758852.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 + 2 \\cdot 2 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"143\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>with minor edits from ~shaopl2022\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5\">Solution 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Realize that 2 of the solutions are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/1/1a1ec65248915a075962658a29dd97a7ef764be9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathit{UDUDUD}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"85\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/7/3671d331dd8142c4a60304f9ec9ea1d0cbf023f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathit{UUUDDD}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"85\" height=\"14\" /> which both consist of 3<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/b/e2bbebb3bd73f1ae5c64098ab0244f739abf7ca4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$U$\" width=\"14\" height=\"12\" />’s and 3<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />’s. Then, there are five gaps where the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/b/e2bbebb3bd73f1ae5c64098ab0244f739abf7ca4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$U$\" width=\"14\" height=\"12\" />’s can go in the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />’s so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/a/66a140486a6900048ea83c3db3adc932efad6f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"54\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p>~OddPeppyBoots\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Daily_Dose_of_Math\">Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Daily Dose of Math\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/qJqrFauo3lQ\">https://youtu.be/qJqrFauo3lQ</a>\n</p><p>~Thesmartgreekmathdude\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_DDM\">Video Solution by DDM</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by DDM\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/TMTTu6kfwqE\">https://youtu.be/TMTTu6kfwqE</a>\n</p><p>~piggydude\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solutions\">Video Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/BaE00H2SHQM?si=GTocuz7rsKFCrPn3&amp;t=2986\">https://youtu.be/BaE00H2SHQM?si=GTocuz7rsKFCrPn3&amp;t=2986</a>\n~Math-X\n</p><p>Video by MathTalks😉==\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/qAwRUj2N46c?si=QDUY8ZUVFP29Eg4c\">https://youtu.be/qAwRUj2N46c?si=QDUY8ZUVFP29Eg4c</a>\n</p>\n<pre>~rc1219\n</pre>\n<p>.<span style=\"color:red\">$/%../cd...\n</span></p><p>Video Solution 2 by Central Valley Math Circle(Goes through the full thought process)==\nhttps://youtu.be/aMmHkyEOmAc\n~mr_mathman\n</p><p>Video Solution 3 (A Clever Explanation You&#8217;ll Get Instantly)==\nhttps://youtu.be/5ZIFnqymdDQ?si=n9jyl0QHXLbaKz3I&amp;t=1363\n</p><p>~hsnacademy$ (Error compiling LaTeX. Unknown error_msg)<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/c/edc30e7895b9c1984cf8645a99e73d797498c057.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[?/\\]\" width=\"